### Get an user by it's id
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/7

### Get all users with a teacher token
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: {{baroniToken}}

### Get all users with a student token
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: {{carolineToken}}



